0 49 710 [
[(This patch takes the same principle as the earlier "C05.sampler.oneshot",)]
[(but allows you to parameterize sample playback. Since we must wait 5 msec)]
[(before starting the playback, we store all the parameters in [f] objects,)]
[(and recall them to construct the new note. Transposition is done by)]
[(altering the amount to play back in the \050artificial\051 ten thousand seconds)]
[(\0501e+07\051. The playback segment can be altered to start in the middle of the)]
[(sample instead of the beginning, and you can change the duration and rise)]
[(and decay times.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
